message: "If you use this software or its benchmarks, please cite the ICAART 2027 paper below."
title: "IntentFlow: artifact of the ICAART 2027 paper on intent-conditioned argument mediation"
abstract: >-
  Runtime mediator for tool-using LLM agents that checks each authority-bearing argument
  against an intent contract and the provenance of its value, with the benchmarks, decision
  logs and scripts behind every number of the paper.
